    {
      "kind": "letter",
      "title": "Dispatch orders",
      "note": "From the Station Master",
      "letterhead": "MAXIMA STATION · OFFICE OF THE STATION MASTER",
      "address": "Sector Zero, Courier Ring, Deck 1",
      "date": "Station day 10,001",
      "to": "To: Courier Max, Bay 7",
      "style": "type",
      "body": "<p>Max,</p><p>You have heard the news by now: the Core has cracked and the warp lanes are failing. Every courier on the ring has been grounded except you, because you are the only one who has flown all five sectors and come back with the cargo intact.</p><p>Your orders are simple and impossible. Find the ten star-shards. Carry them through the crystal gates, sector by sector. Fly the Maelstrom. Bring them home to the Heart.</p><p>The pod is fueled. The trading posts will take your credits. Hail anyone you meet; most of them will be glad to see a courier.</p><p>Couriers deliver. Deliver this one.</p>",
      "signature": "Station Master Orla Venn"
    },
